  "markdown": "[Skip to main content](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#main-content)\n\n# GlobalEnterprise  Maintenance\n\nOne subscription. Fixed pricing. Global AV/UC support.\n\nScroll to bottom of the hero section\n\n![MTR-105 Jupiter Crestron](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MTR-105JupiterCrestronts1070-5316-3quarter-oak-scaled-1.jpg)\n\n### 24/7 Global Service\n\nAVI-SPL’s Enterprise Maintenance subscription provides scalable 24/7 global technical support and maintenance for your audio-visual and unified collaboration spaces. We offer a single subscription and payment to simplify budgeting and management and reduce your total cost of ownership.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n### End-to-End Lifecycle Support\n\nFlexible Subscriptions\nPortability\nConsistency\nProductivity\n\n![Futuristic control room with Earth view, interactive panels, holographic display, and a glowing circular structure as ceiling light.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/MOTF_Journey-of-the-Pioneers_L5%C2%A9ATELIER-BRUECKNER_Giovanni-Emilio-Galanello-300dpi-319-1-lr-color-edit-2-scaled.jpg)\n\nSubscription options help you keep rooms future-ready.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n![A tech store interior with a large purple cityscape display, gadgets on white shelves, black grid ceiling, and gray tiled floors.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Times-Square-Huge-Wall-Wrap-LED-T-Mobile.jpg)\n\nMove services to new rooms and locations to make upgrades easy.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n![Modern exhibit space: interactive displays, info panels, big digital screen; visitors engaged. Concrete floors, wood accents.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/McDonalds-2.jpg)\n\nDeliver better user experiences with consistent service across all locations. With technicians around the world, we understand local intricacies and methods.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n![Person in front of screen with wavy lines: Real-time weather data visualization plus weather app stats.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Verizon.jpg)\n\nWe support over 700 manufacturers so teams can use their preferred solutions.\n\n[Contact Us](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-scaled.jpg)\n\n### Is Enterprise Maintenance Right for You?\n\nThis subscription is ideal for collaboration environments with frequent technology changes, site moves, or long-term migration plans.\n\n- Enable cost protection, simplify budgeting, and eliminate support contracting hassles\n\n- Support for changing room technologies is automatically included\n\n- Easily transfer support coverage from one covered location to another with no impact on costs or term\n\nWe’re ready to help you find the best service subscription.\n\nOur Other services\n\n### Keepingyourteamand  yourbusinessconnected\n\n[Contact](https://avispl.com/services/enterprise-maintenance/#contact)\n\n[![A woman at a desk joins a video call on a laptop with four smiling people, holding a pen and notebook by charts and papers.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Voice-cloud-calling-Img-v2-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Collaboration as a Service**](https://avispl.com/services/collaboration-as-a-service/) [![A technician in a black shirt examines cables by server racks in a tech-filled room with a tiled ceiling, creating an industrial vibe.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/Support-and-Maintenance-1024x683.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Global Deployment**](https://avispl.com/services/global-deployment/) [![Lecture hall with rows of chairs, tables facing screens showing AVI-SPL logo; overhead lights, exit signs visible.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Rose-State-Colleges-Tanenbaum-Aerospace-and-Cybersecurity-Center-tiered-lecture-hall-with-Epson-projectors-on-1024x594.jpg)\\\\\n\\\\\n**Professional Services**](https://avispl.com/services/professional-services/)\n\n12\n\n![Woman in orange blouse on video call, holding paper. Notebooks and pen on desk; airy room with plants in background.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/content-module-1.jpg)\n\nCase Study\n\n### Enhance Employee Experiences\n\nHow services deliver a consistent, positive employee experience.\n\n[View More](https://avispl.com/resources/case-studies/tampa-international-airport-skycenter-one/)\n\n### Partners\n\nWe partner with leading collaboration providers.\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)\n\n[![cisco logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/cisco-seeklogo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/cisco/)[![crestron logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Creston-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/crestron/)[![Google logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/google-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/google/)[![HP Poly logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/hp-poly-large.svg)](https://avispl.com/hp-poly/)[![Logitech Logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/logitech-Logo-2.svg)](https://avispl.com/logitech/)[![Microsoft logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/microsoft-Logo-1.svg)](https://avispl.com/microsoft/)[![Neat logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/Neat-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/neat/)[![Q-SYS logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/q-sys.svg)](https://avispl.com/q-sys/)[![Sennheiser logo: stylized S icon on the left, followed by bold SENNHEISER in capitals. Simple black and white design.](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Sennheiser-Logo.png)](https://avispl.com/sennheiser/)[![zoom-logo](https://avispl.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/zoom-logo.svg)](https://avispl.com/zoom/)",
